  <NAME>Regulation of chemosensitivity in pancreatic cancer cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>Regulation of chemosensitivity in pancreatic cancer cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>We performed RNA-seq to investigate gene expression changes in pancreatic cancer cells following chemotherapeutic drug treatment. We identify a reversible senescence state among the drug-tolerant persister cells. Overall design: RNA-seq was performed in MIA PaCa-2 cells in biological triplicates under normal culture conditions and under various conditions of drug treatment (Torin 1 and gemcitabine).</DESCRIPTION>
